{"id":"64ef4292-3e2c-4766-af91-714e474474b5","object":"chat.completion","created":1793244773,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"thought\":\"Record p31-32 evidence (acting discussion, interacting intro, social capabilities) into the multi_agent and tool_use notes, then request the next batch.\",\"code\":\"n1=write_note(title='multi_agent',content='p31-32 §3.4 讨论总结 acting：AI 科研工具尚不能独立产出突破性成果，科学新颖性能否自动定义存疑；但文献分析、构思、实验搭建、写作等已带来实际生产力，也加重同行评审压力。真实世界行动需 grounding：世界模型与 VLA 让机器人理解物理环境，规划可想象未来、防止不可执行命令。伦理法律：医疗诊断、金融交易助手责任归属未决。§4 互动：传统 LLM 无跨上下文记忆、不预规划；agentic LLM 有记忆与规划、反思回路可主动行动。§4.1 社会能力：语用能力仍低于人类，agent 的记忆与多模态改善情境理解；礼貌提升信任与表现，共情受记忆增强。§4.1.2 策略行为：迭代囚徒困境中 LLaMa2/LLaMa3/GPT3.5 谨慎，对手背叛率低时才合作，总体至少与典型人类一样合作。',evidence_ids=['ev-2c646589154451e7b722','ev-1d8af21fdc46c86a5055'],section='multi_agent')\\nprint(n1.get('note_id'),n1.get('chars'))\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"ev-2c646589154451e7b722\",\"ev-1d8af21fdc46c86a5055\"]}"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9152,"completion_tokens":359,"total_tokens":9511,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":4480},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":4480,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":4672},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}